 # Experiment directory and findings
 
+## Speaker demo v1 — 2026-10-13
+
+Status: software verified; acoustic training, speaker backend, export and live
+validation pending. Base: `7d8296c96e19e1e65fc3f0cd1b82d2391df33dbc`.
+The new study tests class/speaker-balanced and contrastive fixed-demo training,
+a separate one-command wake-owner policy, and action-free ncnn replay. It does
+not change installed models, thresholds or shipping capture behavior.
+Local evidence: 41 focused tests, 10,000 numerical ownership checks, a 12,000-trial
+fixture accounting check and an optimization smoke; no measured human accuracy gain.
+See [protocol](experiments/speaker-demo-v1/protocol.json),
+[verification](experiments/speaker-demo-v1/verification.json),
+[report](docs/EXPERIMENT-speaker-demo-v1.md) and
+[execution handoff](docs/HANDOFF-speaker-demo-v1.md).
